{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i><strong>You are the Elements!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as &quot;<i>forests</i>&quot;, &quot;<i>tides&quot;</i>\u00a0or even &quot;<i>people</i>&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wisps of the Elements</i></strong> is a grid-based rogue-lite. Each element has a special effect: Fire and Stone aim at controlling the board, while Air and Water get bonuses and penalties depending on the tide cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are matched at random, ensuring that each group of opponents is unique. With every expedition comes a new choice of spells; build powerful synergies or you'll be easily countered. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for a good challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wisps of the Elements</i></strong> is difficult by design. There is no xp nor equipment to increase your stats - only your logic and knowledge of the game. The enemies all have unique abilities, and an AI smart enough to use them in synergy. So\u2026 still interested?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2767430?t=1761329698","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761329698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/ec856111a8828fe1310b406f5918dd84716f1375/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761329698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/ec856111a8828fe1310b406f5918dd84716f1375/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761329698","categories":[{"